      "question": "Four of the following five figures are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Select the figure that does not belong to that group.",
      "questionHtml": "<p><span style=\"\">Four of the following five figures are alike in a certain way and thus form a group. Select the figure that does not belong to that group.</span></p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/08/F2_Savita_Defence_25-8-23_D22.png\" style=\"width: 434px; height: 106px;\" /></p>\n",
