    {
      "id": "1ee33dc500f3-q2",
      "number": 2,
      "question": "Which of the following options is the wrong figure in the series?",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Which of the following options is the wrong figure in the series?</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F4_Shailendra%20Rajawat_28-5-2021_Swati_D27.png\" style=\"width: 332px; height: 114px;\" /></p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "A",
          "html": "A"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "B",
          "html": "B"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "C",
          "html": "C"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "D",
          "html": "D"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The pattern followed here is: The arrows are placed as, In the first circle there is<strong> arrow pointing upwards</strong>, then In the <strong>2nd circle a new arrow comes which points</strong> <strong>downwards</strong>. In the 3rd circle there are<strong> 3 arrows in the order 1st upward, 2nd downward then 3rd upward</strong>, so, in the 4th circle there will be <strong>4 arrows 1st pointing</strong> <strong>upwards, 2nd downwards, 3rd upwards and 4th downwards</strong>. So, figure D doesn&#39;t follow the pattern here.</p>\n\n<p>Hence, <strong>&quot;option figure 4&quot;</strong> doesn&#39;t follow the pattern here in the series.</p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/05/F4_Shailendra%20Rajawat_28-5-2021_Swati_D27.png"
      ],
