      "id": "1ee33dc500f3-q3",
      "number": 3,
      "question": "Out of the given options, three are similar in a certain manner. However, one option is NOT like the other three. Select the option which is different from the rest.",
      "questionHtml": "<p>Out of the given options, three are similar in a certain manner. However, one option is NOT like the other three. Select the option which is different from the rest.</p>\n",
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "A",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D3.png\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "B",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D4.png\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "C",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D5.png\" />"
        },
        {
          "id": "D",
          "text": "",
          "html": "<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D6.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" />"
        }
      ],
      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p>The logic follows here&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D3.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>i)The given figure the triangle is present in top right&nbsp;corner and moving in anticlockwise, similarly the equal to sign&nbsp;&nbsp;is present in top left corner and moving in anticlockwise, product sign present in the middle of the left side, positive sign is present in the middle of the right side and circle is present in centre of&nbsp;bottom.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D3.png\" />&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>ii)The given figure the triangle is present in top right&nbsp;corner and moving in anticlockwise, similarly the equal to sign&nbsp;&nbsp;is present in top left corner and moving in anticlockwise, product sign present in the middle of the left side, positive sign is present in the middle of the right side and circle is present in centre of&nbsp;bottom.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D5.png\" /></p>\n\n<p>iii)The given figure the triangle is present in top centre&nbsp;&nbsp;and moving in anticlockwise, similarly the equal to sign&nbsp;&nbsp;is present in bottom&nbsp;left corner and moving in anticlockwise, product sign present in the bottom&nbsp;of the right side, positive sign is present in the middle of the right side and&nbsp; circle is present in the middle left side.</p>\n\n<p>&nbsp;<img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D6.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 81px;\" /></p>\n\n<p>iv)All the signs are present except the square is not present in the previous three figures.</p>\n\n<p>If we compare the figures given then we can clearly see that in the first three there is not square shape is present. But if we look at the fourthe figure the square is present.</p>\n\n<p>Hence the correct answer is <strong>option 4.</strong></p>\n",
      "images": [
        "https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/21/10/F2_Rohit_Ravi_18.10.21_D3.png",
