      "correctAnswer": "D",
      "solution": "<p style=\"\">According to the question:-</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F1_Savita_Railways_27-2-23_D28.png\" style=\"width: 81px; height: 106px;\" />=&gt;The angle formed is&nbsp;of 90&ordm; or right angle.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F1_Savita_Railways_27-2-23_D29.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 106px;\" /><span style=\"\">=&gt;&nbsp;</span><strong><span style=\"\">The angle formed is</span><span style=\"\">&nbsp;less than&nbsp;90</span><span style=\"\">&ordm;, thus is an acute angle.</span></strong></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F1_Savita_Railways_27-2-23_D30.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 106px;\" /><span style=\"\">=&gt;&nbsp; &nbsp;The angle formed is&nbsp;of 90</span><span style=\"\">&ordm; or right angle.</span></p>\n\n<p style=\"\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://storage.googleapis.com/tb-img/production/23/02/F1_Savita_Railways_27-2-23_D31.png\" style=\"width: 82px; height: 105px;\" /><span style=\"\">=&gt;The angle formed is&nbsp;of 90</span><span style=\"\">&ordm; or right angle.</span></p>\n\n<div style=\"\">So,<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;all option except figure (B) is an acute angle instead of right angle.</span></div>\n\n<div style=\"\">&nbsp;</div>\n\n<div style=\"\">Hence, the correct answer is<span style=\"font-weight: 700;\">&nbsp;&quot;Option - (4)&quot;.&nbsp;</span></div>\n",
